# Rapport d'Architecture  

---  

## 1. Setup & Stack Technique  

- **Frontend**  
  - Framework : React 18 (TypeScript)  
  - UI library : MUI v5  
  - State management : Redux Toolkit  
  - Routing : React Router v6  
  - Build : Vite  

- **Backend**  
  - Runtime : Node.js 20 LTS  
  - Framework : NestJS 10 (TypeScript)  
  - Validation : class‑validator / class‑transformer  
  - Authentication : Passport‑JWT  

- **Base de données**  
  - SGBD : PostgreSQL 15  
  - ORM : TypeORM 0.3  

- **Déploiement / DevOps**  
  - Containerisation : Docker + Docker‑Compose  
  - Orchestration : Kubernetes (GKE)  
  - CI/CD : GitHub Actions (lint, test, build, push)  
  - Infra as Code : Terraform (GCP)  
  - Monitoring : Prometheus + Grafana  
  - Logging : Loki / Fluent Bit  

---  

## 2. Schéma Relationnel de la Base de Données  

| Entité | Table | PK | FK | Relation |
|--------|-------|----|----|----------|
| User | `users` | `id` (UUID) | – | 1‑N → `tasks` |
| Category | `categories` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` (UUID) | 1‑N → `tasks` |
| Task | `tasks` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` (UUID) <br> `category_id` (UUID) | N‑1 ← `users` <br> N‑1 ← `categories` |
| TaskTag | `task_tags` | `id` (UUID) | – | N‑N via `task_tag_assignments` |
| TaskTagAssignment | `task_tag_assignments` | composite PK (`task_id`, `tag_id`) | `task_id` (UUID) <br> `tag_id` (UUID) | N‑N ↔ `tasks` & `task_tags` |
| Statistic | `statistics` | `id` (UUID) | `user_id` (UUID) | 1‑N → `statistics` (historique) |

- **Contraintes**  
  - `users.email` unique  
  - `categories.name` unique per `user_id`  
  - `tasks.title` not null  
  - `task_tag_assignments` primary key = (`task_id`, `tag_id`)  

---  

## 3. Architecture Backend & APIs  

- **API Gateway** (NestJS) – prefix `/api/v1`  
- **Familles d’API**  
  - **Auth** : `/auth/register`, `/auth/login`, `/auth/refresh` (POST)  
  - **Users** : `/users/me` (GET, PATCH)  
  - **Categories** : `/categories` (GET, POST), `/categories/:id` (GET, PATCH, DELETE)  
  - **Tasks** : `/tasks` (GET, POST), `/tasks/:id` (GET, PATCH, DELETE)  
  - **Task Tags** : `/tags` (GET, POST), `/tags/:id` (GET, PATCH, DELETE)  
  - **Statistics** : `/stats/summary` (GET)  

- **Contrôleurs**  
  - `AuthController`  
  - `UserController`  
  - `CategoryController`  
  - `TaskController`  
  - `TagController`  
  - `StatsController`  

- **Services** (injection NestJS)  
  - `AuthService` (JWT issuance, refresh)  
  - `UserService` (profile CRUD)  
  - `CategoryService` (CRUD, validation)  
  - `TaskService` (CRUD, tag linking, status)  
  - `TagService` (CRUD)  
  - `StatsService` (aggregation queries)  

- **Middlewares / Guards**  
  - `JwtAuthGuard` (global)  
  - `RolesGuard` (future extension)  

- **WebSocket** (optional)  
  - Namespace `/ws/tasks` – events `taskCreated`, `taskUpdated`, `taskDeleted` (Socket.io)  

---  

## 4. Architecture Frontend et Intégration  

- **Structure du projet**  
  - `src/pages/` (React Router)  
  - `src/components/` (MUI, reusable)  
  - `src/store/` (Redux slices)  
  - `src/api/` (Axios instance, interceptors)  

- **Sécurité**  
  - Stockage du JWT : HttpOnly Secure SameSite cookie (set by backend)  
  - Refresh token via silent endpoint `/auth/refresh` (axios interceptor)  

- **Communication**  
  - REST : Axios baseURL `https://api.example.com/api/v1`  
  - WebSocket : Socket.io client `wss://api.example.com/ws/tasks` (optional)  

- **Gestion d’état**  
  - `authSlice` (token, user)  
  - `categorySlice` (list, selected)  
  - `taskSlice` (list, filters, pagination)  
  - `statsSlice` (summary)  

- **Build & Deploy**  
  - `docker build -t frontend:latest .`  
  - Image déployée en tant que pod `frontend` dans le même cluster GKE, service type `LoadBalancer`  

---  

*Fin du rapport.*